好吧，他確實設法保守了自己的身份秘密

361
00:14:05,580 --> 00:14:06,620
for a long time.
許久。

362
00:14:07,960 --> 00:14:10,200
Rachel got Ross the tuxedo
瑞秋給羅斯穿上燕尾服

363
00:14:10,200 --> 00:14:12,000
that Val Kilmer wore in Batman.
瓦爾·基爾默在《蝙蝠俠》中穿的那件衣服。

364
00:14:12,700 --> 00:14:15,160
Okay, Batman is so much cooler than James Bond.
好吧，蝙蝠俠比詹姆士龐德酷多了。

365
00:14:15,340 --> 00:14:16,740
What are you talking about?
你在說什麼？

366
00:14:16,980 --> 00:14:18,460
007 has all those gadgets.
007 擁有所有這些小玩意。

367
00:14:18,900 --> 00:14:20,500
Batman has a utility belt.
蝙蝠俠有一條實用腰帶。

368
00:14:20,900 --> 00:14:22,380
007 has a fancy car.
007有一輛豪華汽車。

369
00:14:22,740 --> 00:14:24,360
Batman has the Batmobile.
蝙蝠俠擁有蝙蝠車。

370
00:14:26,960 --> 00:14:29,000
007 gets all the ladies.
007得到了所有女士的青睞。

371
00:14:29,980 --> 00:14:30,940
Batman has Robin.
蝙蝠俠有羅賓。

372
00:14:30,940 --> 00:14:31,640
ESPN.
ESPN。

373
00:14:36,420 --> 00:14:38,040
We get ESPN, right?
我們有 ESPN，對吧？

374
00:14:41,580 --> 00:14:44,520
How about you go put on your 007 tuxedo,
你去穿上你的007燕尾服怎麼樣？

375
00:14:44,720 --> 00:14:46,340
and I'll make you a nice martini?
我會給你一杯美味的馬丁尼？

376
00:14:46,760 --> 00:14:48,840
Actually, I don't like martinis.
事實上，我不喜歡馬丁尼。

377
00:14:49,300 --> 00:14:50,680
Well, how about a yoo-hoo with the funny straw?
嗯，用有趣的吸管來玩一下喲嗬怎麼樣？

378
00:14:51,040 --> 00:14:51,720
Ooh, yum!
哦，嗯！

379
00:14:55,040 --> 00:14:55,480
Hey.
嘿。

380
00:14:55,640 --> 00:14:55,800
Hey.
嘿。

381
00:14:56,060 --> 00:14:58,200
Listen, I know the invitation says 6 o'clock,
聽著，我知道邀請函上寫的是六點鐘，

382
00:14:58,200 --> 00:15:00,600
but does that mean you want people to get there at 6,
但這是否意味著你希望人們 6 點到達那裡，

383
00:15:00,660 --> 00:15:02,420
or the show's gonna start right at 6?
或者演出會在六點開始？

384
00:15:02,780 --> 00:15:03,480
The show.
演出。

385
00:15:06,260 --> 00:15:06,580
Right.
正確的。

386
00:15:07,500 --> 00:15:07,820
Right.
正確的。

387
00:15:08,360 --> 00:15:08,900
The wedding.
婚禮。

388
00:15:09,240 --> 00:15:09,500
Gotcha.
明白了。

389
00:15:10,020 --> 00:15:11,740
But, I mean, it's gonna start a little late, right?
但是，我的意思是，這會開始得有點晚，對吧？

390
00:15:11,760 --> 00:15:13,120
I mean, weddings start late, right?
我的意思是，婚禮開始得很晚，對嗎？

391
00:15:13,500 --> 00:15:15,060
Have you ever been to one of my weddings?
你參加過我的一場婚禮嗎？

392
00:15:16,720 --> 00:15:17,280
Ah, yeah.
啊，是的。

393
00:15:17,360 --> 00:15:18,160
Well, look, the thing is,
嗯，看，事情是，

394
00:15:18,180 --> 00:15:20,500
it's the same day as my niece's christening,
那天是我姪女的洗禮

395
00:15:20,800 --> 00:15:23,100
and I really want my parents to be there in time to see me,
我真的希望我的父母能夠及時趕到現場來看我，

396
00:15:23,360 --> 00:15:24,700
because my part's just in the beginning.
因為我的部分才剛開始。

397
00:15:24,740 --> 00:15:25,880
I'm not even in the rest of the show.
我什至沒有參加演出的其餘部分。

398
00:15:25,920 --> 00:15:26,200
Wedding.
婚禮。

399
00:15:28,200 --> 00:15:30,040
The wedding starts at 6.
婚禮六點開始。

400
00:15:30,280 --> 00:15:31,840
Okay, okay, I totally hear you.
好吧，好吧，我完全聽到了。

401
00:15:32,580 --> 00:15:33,440
Ooh, how about this?
哦，這個怎麼樣？

402
00:15:33,740 --> 00:15:35,440
I vamp a little till they get there.
我稍微踩了一下直到他們到達那裡。

403
00:15:36,900 --> 00:15:37,780
You'll vamp?
你會吸鞋嗎？

404
00:15:38,040 --> 00:15:39,940
Yeah, yeah, you know, I'll, like, warm up the crowd,
是的，是的，你知道，我會，就像，溫暖人群，

405
00:15:40,200 --> 00:15:41,100
ask them where they're from.
問他們來自哪裡。

406
00:15:41,360 --> 00:15:43,440
Because in Joey Tribbiani, you get a minister
因為喬伊·崔比亞尼是牧師

407
00:15:43,440 --> 00:15:45,320
and you get an entertainer.
然後你就會得到一個藝人。

408
00:15:45,760 --> 00:15:46,580
I'm a ministainer.
我是迷你服務生。

409
00:15:48,860 --> 00:15:50,200
There is no one better.
沒有人比他更好了。

410
00:15:50,280 --> 00:15:51,280
There's no one greater.
沒有人比他更偉大了。

411
00:15:52,460 --> 00:15:52,900
Huh?
啊？

412
00:15:54,420 --> 00:15:56,600
Oh, please, God, don't vamp.
哦，上帝啊，求求你別再欺負人了。

413
00:15:57,820 --> 00:16:00,800
Oh, okay, well, maybe, maybe I talk to Chandler.
哦，好吧，好吧，也許，也許我會和錢德勒談談。

414
00:16:00,920 --> 00:16:03,440
Maybe he'd like to get married at 007 o'clock.
也許他想在007點結婚。

415
00:16:05,660 --> 00:16:06,740
All right, all right.
好吧，好吧。

416
00:16:06,780 --> 00:16:08,580
I will give you ten extra minutes.
我再給你十分鐘。

417
00:16:08,740 --> 00:16:09,480
Ten, that is it.
十個，就是這樣。

418
00:16:09,520 --> 00:16:10,940
Oh, that's great. Thank you so much.
哦，那太好了。太感謝了。

419
00:16:11,020 --> 00:16:11,260
All right.
好的。

420
00:16:11,660 --> 00:16:12,660
Well, we're in luck.
好吧，我們很幸運。

421
00:16:12,860 --> 00:16:14,080
Your tux fits perfectly.
你的禮服非常合身。

422
00:16:19,860 --> 00:16:22,400
Chandler, that jacket, it's way too big.
錢德勒，那件夾克太大了。

423
00:16:22,680 --> 00:16:23,700
Oh, that's okay.
哦，沒關係。

424
00:16:23,860 --> 00:16:25,440
The pants are way too small.
褲子太小了。

425
00:16:27,200 --> 00:16:27,880
Thank you.
謝謝。

426
00:16:30,700 --> 00:16:33,080
I'm sorry, sweetie, you cannot wear that.
對不起，親愛的，你不能穿那個。

427
00:16:33,680 --> 00:16:35,680
Now, this means Ross is going to be the only cool one.
現在，這意味著羅斯將成為唯一一個很酷的人。

428
00:16:36,540 --> 00:16:38,460
Something, by the way, I never thought I would say.
順便說一句，我從來沒想過我會說出來。

429
00:16:39,980 --> 00:16:41,340
Dude, take that thing off.
夥計，把那個東西拿掉吧。

430
00:16:41,380 --> 00:16:42,140
You look like a fool.
你看起來像個傻瓜。

431
00:16:43,700 --> 00:16:44,960
Now, come on, come next door with me.
現在，來吧，跟我到隔壁去吧。

432
00:16:44,980 --> 00:16:46,920
I got some minister headdresses I want you to take a look at.
我有一些部長的頭飾想讓你看看。

433
00:16:50,460 --> 00:16:52,440
How can you not remember us kissing?
你怎麼不記得我們接吻了？

434
00:16:53,220 --> 00:16:53,920
I don't know.
我不知道。

435
00:16:53,920 --> 00:16:56,680
I don't remember a lot of things that never happened.
我不記得很多從未發生過的事。

436
00:16:58,840 --> 00:17:01,280
Come on, remember we were on the sleeping porch.
來吧，記住我們在睡覺的門廊上。

437
00:17:01,740 --> 00:17:02,980
We couldn't stop giggling.
我們忍不住咯咯地笑。

438
00:17:03,720 --> 00:17:06,000
And our coconuts kept knocking together.
我們的椰子一直敲在一起。

439
00:17:06,240 --> 00:17:08,360
Oh, somewhere Joey's head is exploding.
哦，喬伊的頭在某個地方爆炸了。

440
00:17:10,740 --> 00:17:11,800
Come on, listen, I'm sorry.
來吧，聽著，對不起。

441
00:17:11,880 --> 00:17:12,960
I don't want to make you uncomfortable,
我不想讓你不舒服

442
00:17:13,200 --> 00:17:14,860
but I told Phoebe that it happened,
但我告訴菲比這件事發生了

443
00:17:14,900 --> 00:17:16,260
and she doesn't believe me.
她不相信我。

444
00:17:17,920 --> 00:17:19,260
I'm sorry, Ray Ray.
對不起，雷雷。

445
00:17:19,400 --> 00:17:21,600
I mean, if I thought it happened, I would say it.
我的意思是，如果我認為這件事發生了，我就會說出來。

446
00:17:22,880 --> 00:17:24,140
Maybe I passed out,
也許我昏倒了，

447
00:17:24,220 --> 00:17:25,820
and you did stuff to me while I was sleeping.
你趁我睡覺的時候對我做了事。

448
00:17:26,520 --> 00:17:26,920
No!
不！

449
00:17:28,220 --> 00:17:28,620
Right.
正確的。

450
00:17:29,300 --> 00:17:30,080
Okay, fine.
好吧，好吧。

451
00:17:30,420 --> 00:17:31,500
You don't have to admit it.
你不必承認這一點。

452
00:17:32,240 --> 00:17:34,000
Because I know that it happened.
因為我知道它發生了。

453
00:17:35,560 --> 00:17:35,960
Okay.
好的。

454
00:17:36,400 --> 00:17:37,480
No, you have to admit it.
不，你必須承認這一點。

455
00:17:37,500 --> 00:17:38,020
We kissed.
我們接吻了。

456
00:17:38,140 --> 00:17:38,580
Say it.
說吧。

457
00:17:40,180 --> 00:17:41,020
Rachel, it's okay.
雷切爾，沒關係。

458
00:17:41,120 --> 00:17:42,380
You don't have to do this, all right?
你不必這樣做，好嗎？

459
00:17:42,380 --> 00:17:42,960
I believe you.
我相信你。

460
00:17:43,580 --> 00:17:45,820
Okay, if you say that you kissed Melissa,
好吧，如果你說你吻了梅麗莎，

461
00:17:45,940 --> 00:17:46,940
then you kissed Melissa.
然後你吻了梅麗莎。

462
00:17:47,680 --> 00:17:48,600
Thank you, Phoebe.
謝謝你，菲比。

463
00:17:48,880 --> 00:17:49,060
Okay.
好的。

464
00:17:50,660 --> 00:17:51,500
She didn't.
她沒有。

465
00:17:51,680 --> 00:17:52,140
I know.
我知道。

466
00:17:56,380 --> 00:17:56,840
Hey.
嘿。

467
00:17:57,380 --> 00:17:58,680
Did you just carry that around?
你剛剛帶著它嗎？

468
00:17:59,280 --> 00:17:59,680
Yes.
是的。

469
00:18:00,020 --> 00:18:03,000
I find it to be something of a conversation piece.
我發現它是一個談話片段。

470
00:18:04,300 --> 00:18:06,200
Between you and...
你和...之間

471
00:18:06,200 --> 00:18:06,640
Gunther.
岡瑟.

472
00:18:08,320 --> 00:18:09,960
Hey, hey, why don't we put them on?
嘿，嘿，我們為什麼不穿上它們呢？

473
00:18:10,180 --> 00:18:12,940
You know, get a picture of Batman and James Bond together.
你知道，拍一張蝙蝠俠和詹姆士龐德在一起的照片。

474
00:18:13,560 --> 00:18:14,740
I would, but mine doesn't fit.
我願意，但我的不適合。

475
00:18:14,820 --> 00:18:15,740
The pants are a little tight.
褲子有點緊。

476
00:18:16,020 --> 00:18:16,620
A little tight?
有點緊？

477
00:18:17,180 --> 00:18:19,780
I can see 00 and 7 in those things.
我可以在那些東西中看到 00 和 7。

478
00:18:21,160 --> 00:18:22,360
Well, that stinks.
嗯，那很臭。

479
00:18:22,680 --> 00:18:25,580
I was looking forward to us wearing our celebrity tuxes together.
我很期待我們一起穿著名人禮服。

480
00:18:25,980 --> 00:18:27,280
Does that mean you're not going to be wearing yours?
這是否意味著你不會穿你的衣服？

481
00:18:27,620 --> 00:18:28,200
What, are you kidding?
什麼，你在開玩笑嗎？

482
00:18:28,400 --> 00:18:29,700
It's Batman's tux!
這是蝙蝠俠的禮服！

483
00:18:32,080 --> 00:18:33,040
Let me try it on.
讓我試戴一下。

484
00:18:34,600 --> 00:18:36,040
Okay, but just the jacket.
好吧，但只是夾克。

485
00:18:36,760 --> 00:18:38,500
00 and 7 are not getting in there.
00 和 7 進不去。

486
00:18:41,020 --> 00:18:41,460
Okay.
好的。

487
00:18:44,820 --> 00:18:47,020
Holy double-vented comfort, Batman.
神聖的雙通風口舒適感，蝙蝠俠。

488
00:18:50,120 --> 00:18:50,840
What's this?
這是什麼？

489
00:18:51,160 --> 00:18:51,320
Huh?
啊？

490
00:18:51,800 --> 00:18:53,740
An invitation to the At First Sight premiere?
《一見鍾情》首映式的邀請函？

491
00:18:54,680 --> 00:18:55,800
Oh, my God.
我的天啊。

492
00:18:56,320 --> 00:18:58,000
Val Kilmer didn't wear this in Batman.
瓦爾·基爾默在《蝙蝠俠》中沒有穿這件衣服。

493
00:18:58,240 --> 00:19:00,820
He wore it to the premiere of some tutti-frutti love story
他穿著它參加了一些水果愛情故事的首映式

494
00:19:00,820 --> 00:19:02,140
where he played a blind guy.
他在那裡扮演一個盲人。

495
00:19:02,760 --> 00:19:03,840
Let me see that.
讓我看看。

496
00:19:06,800 --> 00:19:07,840
Oh, man.
哦，夥計。

497
00:19:08,260 --> 00:19:09,680
The only superpower you have
你唯一擁有的超能力

498
00:19:09,680 --> 00:19:11,540
is a slightly heightened sense of smell.
是嗅覺稍微增強。

499
00:19:15,080 --> 00:19:17,320
Hey, Monica, Chandler, can I talk to you guys for a second?
嘿，莫妮卡，錢德勒，我可以跟你們聊聊嗎？

500
00:19:17,520 --> 00:19:18,400
All right, that's it. I give up.
好吧，就是這樣。我放棄。

501
00:19:18,660 --> 00:19:20,000
Whatever you want, you can have it.
無論你想要什麼，你都可以擁有。

502
00:19:20,240 --> 00:19:22,400
You want to sing a song, you want to do a dance,
你想唱歌，你想跳舞，

503
00:19:22,600 --> 00:19:25,280
you want your mom to stand at the altar and scream racial slurs,
你希望媽媽站在祭壇前尖叫種族歧視，

504
00:19:25,580 --> 00:19:26,220
I don't care.
我不在乎。

505
00:19:28,340 --> 00:19:30,600
No, no, I just want to thank you guys
不不不，我只是想謝謝你們

506
00:19:30,600 --> 00:19:31,780
for what you did for my parents.
感謝你為我父母所做的一切。

507
00:19:31,900 --> 00:19:32,720
That was really sweet.
那真是太甜蜜了。

508
00:19:33,080 --> 00:19:35,300
They're so happy they get to be a part of your special day.
他們很高興能夠成為您特殊日子的一部分。

509
00:19:35,860 --> 00:19:36,080
Oh.
哦。

510
00:19:37,560 --> 00:19:38,380
Well, you're welcome.
好吧，不客氣。

511
00:19:38,720 --> 00:19:39,980
And tell them we're really glad they're coming.
並告訴他們我們真的很高興他們能來。

512
00:19:40,240 --> 00:19:41,240
Okay, I will.
好的，我會的。

513
00:19:41,240 --> 00:19:43,640
Oh, check out what they got me to wear for the ceremony.
哦，看看他們讓我在儀式上穿什麼。

514
00:19:46,940 --> 00:19:47,460
Huh?
啊？

515
00:19:48,600 --> 00:19:50,860
I wear it like this when I marry you guys,
我結婚的時候就這麼穿

516
00:19:50,980 --> 00:19:54,180
and then this is for party time.
然後這是聚會時間。

517
00:20:00,600 --> 00:20:01,640
It happened.
它發生了。

518
00:20:02,100 --> 00:20:03,800
I am telling you, it happened.
我告訴你，它發生了。

519
00:20:04,260 --> 00:20:04,560
Hey.
嘿。

520
00:20:05,120 --> 00:20:06,560
It was great meeting you.
很高興見到你。

521
00:20:07,300 --> 00:20:09,920
And, uh, Rachel, I don't think I'll be calling you
而且，呃，Rachel，我想我不會打電話給你

522
00:20:09,920 --> 00:20:12,620
because, um, you know, you've got me weird.
因為，嗯，你知道，你讓我很奇怪。

523
00:20:15,320 --> 00:20:16,460
Take care, you guys.
保重，你們。

524
00:20:17,480 --> 00:20:18,200
What? Wait a minute.
什麼？等一下。

525
00:20:18,460 --> 00:20:19,120
No, wait a minute.
不，等一下。

526
00:20:19,300 --> 00:20:22,560
Okay, look, that night was the one wild thing
好吧，聽著，那天晚上是一件瘋狂的事情

527
00:20:22,560 --> 00:20:24,240
I have ever done in my entire life,
我這輩子做過的事

528
00:20:24,280 --> 00:20:26,160
and I'm not going to let you take that away from me.
我不會讓你把它從我身邊奪走。

529
00:20:26,460 --> 00:20:28,000
Okay, so if you don't remember that,
好吧，如果你不記得了，

530
00:20:28,300 --> 00:20:29,840
maybe you will remember this.
也許你會記得這一點。

531
00:20:33,980 --> 00:20:38,200
Oh, my God.
我的天啊。

532
00:20:39,400 --> 00:20:40,640
You love me.
你愛我。

533
00:20:43,020 --> 00:20:43,580
What?
什麼？

534
00:20:43,780 --> 00:20:45,760
Of course I remember our kiss.
我當然記得我們的吻。

535
00:20:45,860 --> 00:20:47,440
I think about it all the time.
我一直在想這個問題。

536
00:20:48,200 --> 00:20:51,040
I can still hear the coconuts knocking together.
我仍然能聽到椰子碰撞的聲音。

537
